  "description": "It is a library that provides the functionality to simplify the integration of SDC camera devices and LVS video storage devices in the HWSdk protocol for .NET applications,Version 1.0.2 added support for net8,Version 1.0.3 added support for net10. Built with a modular architecture, it enables seamless integration into your existing projects. Maintained and supported by Patrick.Z, it streamlines routine development configurations in .NET applications and takes over heavy, tedious workloads for you.",
